<dialog id="region-notice" aria-labelledby="region-notice-header" data-nosnippet>
  <h2 id="region-notice-header">'Ello, 'Ello, 'Ello, British person!</h2>

  <div class="region-notice-content">
    <h4>What's all this furry stuff about, then?</h4>
    <p>
      With laws and online regulations in the UK continuing to change, we thought it best to speak
      up a little. You might prefer your posts without adequate protection, but your internet
      connection deserves a little more consideration.
    </p>
    <p>
      We value privacy on e621, and now is a good time to give yours some attention. While not
      strictly required, we do recommend that users in the UK <b>use a reputable VPN when browsing
      the site</b> for an extra layer of privacy.
    </p>
    <p>
      We don't endorse any particular provider.<br />
      Instead, put the kettle on and compare a few before you commit; pricing and features vary, so
      find one that works best for you. Your 87 open tabs deserve at least one responsible decision
      today!
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="region-notice-footer">
    <button type="button" id="region-notice-close" class="st-button">Close</button>
  </div>
</dialog>
